  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION lengthOfLIS(nums):\n    LIS = ARRAY_OF_SIZE(LENGTH(nums), INITIAL_VALUE = 1)\n    FOR i FROM LENGTH(nums) - 1 DOWN TO 0 DO:\n        FOR j FROM i + 1 TO LENGTH(nums) - 1 DO:\n            IF nums[i] < nums[j] THEN LIS[i] = MAX(LIS[i], 1 + LIS[j])\n        END FOR\n    END FOR\n    RETURN MAX(LIS)\nEND FUNCTION",
